{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "framework": "playwright",
  "testId": "testim-migrated/tests/webstore/pdp/verify-configurable-product-details-on-pdp-variant2.spec.ts > Webstore - PDP > verify configurable product details on pdp (variant2)",
  "scenario": {
    "summary": "Guest searches the webstore for a configurable parent product by SKU, opens its PDP, selects variant 2 by its Bulb Size/Color/Technology swatches, and validates the variant's details, tiered offers, inventory section and Inventory Check modal (default and other warehouse locations), stock status, info tabs and the Frequently Bought / You May Also Like related products. Read-only; nothing is added to the cart.",
    "steps": [
      "Open the webstore as a guest (empty storageState).",
      "Search for the parent product SKU and assert 'Showing 1 of 1 Results'.",
      "Open the first search result (configurable product PDP).",
      "Assert the attribute groups Bulb Size, Color and Technology, then choose variant 2 by its size, color and technology swatches.",
      "Assert breadcrumb, product name, SKU, brand, short description, retail price, rating, wishlist heart and image of the selected variant.",
      "Assert the three tiered special offers (buy quantity, price per item, discount percentage).",
      "Inventory section is shown for this data (isInventorySectionDisplayed=true): assert default warehouse quantity and name and All Locations quantity, open Inventory Check and assert the default location and each other location (quantity, name, address), then close it.",
      "Assert the stock status text.",
      "Assert Print, See More and Email a Friend buttons and the Details, Specifications, Shipping Info, Reviews and Additional Information tabs and panels.",
      "Assert the Frequently Bought and You May Also Like sections and their product cards (name, Read Reviews, Add to Cart visible)."
    ],
    "entitiesTouched": [
      "product",
      "brand",
      "category",
      "warehouse",
      "store"
    ],
    "stateChanges": [],
    "assertions": [
      "Search for the parent SKU shows exactly one result ('Showing 1 of 1 Results').",
      "Attribute groups contain the labels Bulb Size, Color and Technology.",
      "Breadcrumb equals Home/<category>/<variant name>; heading, SKU:<variant SKU>, Brand:<brand>, short description and retail price match the variant.",
      "Three tiered offers show 'Buy N or more', '$<price>/item' and 'Save <discount>%'.",
      "Inventory section shows the default warehouse quantity and name and the All Locations quantity; Inventory Check shows the default location and nine other locations with quantity, name and address.",
      "Stock status contains 'In Stock (1000)'.",
      "Details, specifications, shipping info and additional information tab panels contain the expected text.",
      "Frequently Bought and You May Also Like sections list the expected related product names with Read Reviews and Add to Cart."
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Title 'verify configurable product details on pdp (variant2)' and step labels '1) Open the configurable product PDP' and '2) Select variant 2 + validate all product details (incl. inventory check)' match the flow; no linked AIO cases.",
      "Spec line 24 searches data.parentProductSKU; line 31 calls validateConfigurableVariant(productDetailPage, data.productVariant) (configurable-pdp.helper.ts:89-193). All data via loadData (spec line 13).",
      "Profile: parent SKU b-100000 FOUND as ConfigurableProduct (stored B-100000), active, 17 active variants; its observed name/brand (Philips Base B22 9-Watt Bulb / Philips) are the parent, not the asserted variant.",
      "Profile: variant SKU z-2510006 FOUND as active SimpleProduct, inventory 1000; related products FOUND as active SimpleProducts. Asserted variant brand is empty (brand lookup NOT_FOUND); that empty value (productVariant.productBrand, json:14) is not listed as a source because the schema needs a non-empty value.",
      "Same key and params as the approved twin variant1 (PRODUCT_CONFIGURABLE_PDP_DETAILS, store MaxwellsHardware, quantityUsed 1).",
      "Gap: PRODUCT_CONFIGURABLE_PDP_DETAILS returns the first variant by SKU, so it cannot supply a distinct second variant; and it has no outputs for the inventory section (default/all-location quantities, warehouse names and addresses of the Inventory Check modal) that this variant asserts.",
      "Data in code: configurable-pdp.helper.ts lines 91-93 hardcode the attribute group names 'Bulb Size', 'Color', 'Technology' (= productVariant.sizeLable/colorLable/techologyLable).",
      "migrate: data only through loadData, but expected values depend on the recorded variant (retail and tier prices, descriptions, warehouse quantities and names, related products) and the attribute labels are also in the helper code."
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "needsReview": true
  },
  "requires": [
    {
      "key": "PRODUCT_CONFIGURABLE_PDP_DETAILS",
      "alias": "pdp",
      "params": {
        "store": "MaxwellsHardware",
        "quantityUsed": 1
      },
      "preferred": {
        "source": 0,
        "required": false
      }
    }
  ],
